    "detailed_description": "In a world ravaged by a monstrous plague, Kurt stands alone \u2013 immune and burdened with an experimental AI chip. Humanity's survival depends on the fragile bond between man and machine. Despot Zombie is a post-apocalyptic third-person shooter where choices matter. Experience intense combat, explore a haunting world, and unravel the secrets within Kurt's mind.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Intense, fast-paced combat against monstrous creatures.<br></li><li> Explore an atmospheric world steeped in dark fantasy and sci-fi. <br></li><li> Decisions impact the game's difficulty and outcome.<br></li><li> A blend of TPS, RPG, and horror elements.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In a world ravaged by a monstrous plague, Kurt stands alone \u2013 immune and burdened with an experimental AI chip. Humanity's survival depends on the fragile bond between man and machine. Despot Zombie is a post-apocalyptic third-person shooter where choices matter. Experience intense combat, explore a haunting world, and unravel the secrets within Kurt's mind.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Intense, fast-paced combat against monstrous creatures.<br></li><li> Explore an atmospheric world steeped in dark fantasy and sci-fi. <br></li><li> Decisions impact the game's difficulty and outcome.<br></li><li> A blend of TPS, RPG, and horror elements.</li></ul>",
